# The Netlify target's two halves (`AWC_TARGET=netlify pnpm build`). `build-netlify/`
# is the static publish directory, `.netlify/` holds the render function and the
# server bundle it imports. Both are build output; neither is `build/`, which is
# the point — see netlify.toml.
/build-netlify/
/.netlify/

